    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Scum_and_Villainy\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy\">Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You can deliver nasty attacks that leave your opponents gasping.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Sneak_Attack\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sneak Attack\">Sneak Attack</a></b> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Rapid_Shot\" title=\"Rapid Shot\">Rapid Shot</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Rapid_Strike\" title=\"Rapid Strike\">Rapid Strike</a></p><p><b>Effect:</b> Any time you would deal additional damage from a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feat\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Feat\">Feat</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Talent\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Talent\">Talent</a> that grants one or more extra dice of damage, you can forgo the extra damage to move the target 2 squares per extra die sacrificed. This movement does not provoke <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Attacks_of_Opportunity\" title=\"Attacks of Opportunity\">Attacks of Opportunity</a>.</p>",
